FILE: vUX-listScroller.js
FEATURE: component-teardown
DATE: 2026-09-17
PRIOR STATE: as left by feature 'resizer-docs'

REASON
assignHandlers() registered a delegated click handler whose return value was discarded,
an anonymous window resize listener, and a scroll listener on the container. destroy()
now detaches all three — the resize handler having been named handleResize — and strips
the layout classes and the inline width/left the component wrote onto the list parent.

